      "title": "TCP: cleanup ECN related flags",
      "message": "TCP: cleanup ECN related flags\n\nThe ECN-Echo flag is abbreviated in RFC 3168 using ECE, not ECN.\nIn addition, when displaying the flags, no abbreviations are\nused. Therefore, do the same for the CWR flag.\n",
      "author_name": "Michael Tuexen",
      "author_email": "tuexen@wireshark.org",
      "authored_date": "2022-08-13T12:00:40.000+02:00",
      "committer_name": "A Wireshark GitLab Utility",
      "committer_email": "gerald+gitlab-utility@wireshark.org",
      "committed_date": "2022-08-13T11:08:55.000+00:00",
